  {
   "id": "nioh-2-remastered-the-complete-edition-143350@1.25.1",
   "gameId": "nioh-2-remastered-the-complete-edition-143350",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.25.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-02-10T10:20:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The game was updated to the 1.25.1 version, you can find the changes of this version below:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・The confirmation button can now be changed from “Controls”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where the lock-on target would switch when the mouse was moved, even if the “Move Camera/Switch Lock-On Target” setting was changed to an option other than “Move Mouse” in “Keyboard & Mouse Settings”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where the mouse sensitivity could become so high that it became impossible to change the settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue which sometimes prevented the selection of certain resolutions and caused the game screen to be cut off due to the Windows settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue which made the game prone to crashing in certain environments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "※ If the game repeatedly crashes in a specific place, please try the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Right-click on “Nioh 2 Complete Edition” in the Steam client ⇒ “Properties” ⇒ “Local File” ⇒ “Verify Integrity of Game Files”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue that could cause the game to crash when displaying the descriptions of equipment special effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Alleviated the issue where the frame rate tended to drop when \"Effect Quality\" was set to \"High\" in \"Graphics Settings\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "※We are continuing to investigate and address this issue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Reduced the tendency for the game to run slowly when certain attacks hit the walls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue that caused black bars to appear on the left and right sides of the screen during multiplayer on ultra-wide monitors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
